  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save patients with cancer in Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healing Venezuela Infrastructure Programme will develop projects to repair, reinstate and buy important medical equipment which is needed to improve the Venezuelan health system.  With your help, an operating theatre at the most important cancer hospital, Padre Machado - which is located in the low income neighbourhood of &quot;El Cementerio&quot; in Caracas - will be back in service to attend not just patients with cancer from the capital, but also individuals from surrounding areas.</narrative>
  </description>
